# social-phone

=========== Herramientas utilizadas en social-phone ===========
-phoneinfoga

=========== Crear imagen ===========
docker build -t phoneinfoga .

=========== Inicar contenedor ===========
Para verlo de la web (recomendado)
docker run --rm -p 5000:5000 sundowndev/phoneinfoga:latest serve

Para verlo de la terminal
docker run --rm sundowndev/phoneinfoga:latest scan -n +5491122334455

=========== Usar phoneinfoga ===========
http://localhost:5000

